---
// Trading day schedule across HOSE, HNX, and UPCoM from 09:00 to 15:00.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 310;

// Map 09:00..15:00 (360 minutes) onto x = 130..870 (width 740)
const xOf = (hour: number, min: number) => 130 + (((hour - 9) * 60 + min) / 360) * 740;
const ticks = [
  { h: 9, m: 0, label: '09:00' },
  { h: 9, m: 15, label: '09:15' },
  { h: 11, m: 30, label: '11:30' },
  { h: 13, m: 0, label: '13:00' },
  { h: 14, m: 30, label: '14:30' },
  { h: 14, m: 45, label: '14:45' },
  { h: 15, m: 0, label: '15:00' },
];
---
<figure class="sbp3-clock">
  <div class="sbp3-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Trading session schedule from 09:00 to 15:00 comparing HOSE (ATO, continuous, lunch, continuous, ATC), HNX (continuous, lunch, continuous, ATC, PLO), and UPCoM (continuous only).">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp3-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>When each order type works across the trading day</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khung giờ giao dịch và loại lệnh hợp lệ trong một ngày trên ba sàn</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Time grid */}
      {ticks.map((t, idx) => (
        <g>
          <line x1={xOf(t.h, t.m)} y1="54" x2={xOf(t.h, t.m)} y2="258" class="sbp3-grid" />
          <text
            x={xOf(t.h, t.m)}
            y={idx % 2 === 0 ? 278 : 294}
            text-anchor="middle"
            class="sbp3-time"
          >
            {t.label}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}

      {/* Row 1: HOSE */}
      <text x="20" y="96" class="sbp3-vname">HOSE</text>
      <rect x={xOf(9, 0)} y="72" width={xOf(9, 15) - xOf(9, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-auc" />
      <text x={(xOf(9, 0) + xOf(9, 15)) / 2} y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-auct">ATO</text>

      <rect x={xOf(9, 15)} y="72" width={xOf(11, 30) - xOf(9, 15)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(9, 15) + xOf(11, 30)) / 2} y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">LO / MP</text>

      <rect x={xOf(11, 30)} y="72" width={xOf(13, 0) - xOf(11, 30)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-lunch" />
      <text x={(xOf(11, 30) + xOf(13, 0)) / 2} y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lunch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nghỉ trưa</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={xOf(13, 0)} y="72" width={xOf(14, 30) - xOf(13, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(13, 0) + xOf(14, 30)) / 2} y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">LO / MP</text>

      <rect x={xOf(14, 30)} y="72" width={xOf(14, 45) - xOf(14, 30)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-auc" />
      <text x={(xOf(14, 30) + xOf(14, 45)) / 2} y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-auct">ATC</text>

      {/* Row 2: HNX */}
      <text x="20" y="156" class="sbp3-vname">HNX</text>
      <rect x={xOf(9, 0)} y="132" width={xOf(11, 30) - xOf(9, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(9, 0) + xOf(11, 30)) / 2} y="156" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">LO / MTL / MAK / MOK</text>

      <rect x={xOf(11, 30)} y="132" width={xOf(13, 0) - xOf(11, 30)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-lunch" />
      <text x={(xOf(11, 30) + xOf(13, 0)) / 2} y="156" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lunch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nghỉ trưa</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={xOf(13, 0)} y="132" width={xOf(14, 30) - xOf(13, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(13, 0) + xOf(14, 30)) / 2} y="156" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">LO / MTL / MAK / MOK</text>

      <rect x={xOf(14, 30)} y="132" width={xOf(14, 45) - xOf(14, 30)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-auc" />
      <text x={(xOf(14, 30) + xOf(14, 45)) / 2} y="156" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-auct">ATC</text>

      <rect x={xOf(14, 45)} y="132" width={xOf(15, 0) - xOf(14, 45)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(14, 45) + xOf(15, 0)) / 2} y="156" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-sub">PLO</text>

      {/* Row 3: UPCoM */}
      <text x="20" y="216" class="sbp3-vname">UPCoM</text>
      <rect x={xOf(9, 0)} y="192" width={xOf(11, 30) - xOf(9, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(9, 0) + xOf(11, 30)) / 2} y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>LO only (continuous)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ LO (khớp liên tục)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={xOf(11, 30)} y="192" width={xOf(13, 0) - xOf(11, 30)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-lunch" />
      <text x={(xOf(11, 30) + xOf(13, 0)) / 2} y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lunch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nghỉ trưa</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={xOf(13, 0)} y="192" width={xOf(15, 0) - xOf(13, 0)} height="38" rx="4" class="sbp3-cont" />
      <text x={(xOf(13, 0) + xOf(15, 0)) / 2} y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp3-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>LO only (continuous)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ LO (khớp liên tục)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>HOSE runs two 15-minute call auctions (ATO at 09:00 and ATC at 14:30) where LO and ATO/ATC mix; HNX adds a post-close PLO window at 14:45–15:00; UPCoM matches continuous LO orders straight from 09:00 to 15:00 with a 90-minute lunch break.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>HOSE có hai phiên định kỳ 15 phút (ATO lúc 09:00 và ATC lúc 14:30); HNX chỉ có ATC và thêm 15 phút PLO sau giờ (14:45–15:00); còn UPCoM khớp lệnh giới hạn liên tục từ 09:00 đến 15:00, nghỉ trưa 11:30–13:00.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp3-clock { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp3-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp3-clock svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp3-clock text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp3-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-vname { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .sbp3-time { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp3-cont { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp3-auc { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp3-lunch { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .sbp3-lbl { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp3-auct { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp3-sub { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp3-clock figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
